  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4602.40 Eligible liquid biofuel",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-03-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4602.40 “Eligible liquid biofuel” means a combustible liquid, not derived from fossil fuel, that if not burned for fuel would be a waste or by-product, or that is produced from a waste or by-product.\n\nSource. #9283, INTERIM, eff 10-1-08, EXPIRED: 3-30-09\n\nNew. #9444, eff 4-3-09; ss by #10468, eff 1-1-14; ss by #12967, eff 1-1-20 (from Env-A 4602.41)",
